		)
		(uuid "4902c022-a812-49d6-8f8f-38235e85045d")
	)
	(text "C1..C6: six IOVDD bypasses; C7: flash. C8: VREG_OUT; C19: VREG_IN, both 1uF.\nC20/C21: DVDD pins 23/50. C22: ADC_AVDD. C23: USB_VDD (shares nearby IOVDD).\nUSB requires module 3V3 from the main board; VBUS is for ESD clamping only, not a power source.\nBOOTSEL_N and DISP_BOOT are ACTIVE LOW. Main host must assert LOW for matrix boot,\nand release to high impedance for operation; STM32 display BOOT0 instead needs HIGH.\nY1 footprint is a 4-pad 3225 candidate; choose and validate crystal / load caps before manufacture."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 360.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8eb8bfb2-368b-456e-bff7-7dfeeffb0ffc")
	)
